        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Lock down sensor specs, installation plan, and safety procedures.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 18383,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello. I have created the draft for the sensor specifications for the pilot assets. This is for T4. You can see it in A4. I listed the vibration and temperature sensors I think we need. Can you please check if this is feasible?",
            "mentions": [
              36422,
