              237177,
              53841
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 560411,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Thanks for putting this together. I've reviewed A4. The sensor models you've selected are good, but the sampling frequency for the vibration sensors on the CNC mills is a bit low. To catch early-stage bearing wear, we'll need at least 20 kHz. I've added a comment in the doc with a link to the recommended specs.",
            "mentions": [
              18383
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "From an operations perspective, my main concern is installation time. How long will it take per machine? We need to make sure it fits within the planned maintenance windows.",
            "mentions": [
              18383
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 237177,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "My team will be doing the installation. We need a clear checklist. Is that something you are making?",
            "mentions": [
              18383
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 18383,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Ok, I can update the frequency. That might change the cost, I will have to check.",
            "mentions": [
              560411
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 18383,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "I think maybe 2-3 hours per machine? It depends on the wiring.",
            "mentions": [
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "2-3 hours is workable if we plan it carefully. We have a 4-hour window scheduled. Let's make sure we have everything staged beforehand to avoid delays. This is critical for T5.",
            "mentions": [
              18383,
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "The installation checklist is T8, which is your responsibility. However, it should be based on the final specs from T4 and T11. Let's get the specs locked down first.",
            "mentions": [
              237177
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8",
              "T4",
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
