          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 560411,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "I've finalized the training materials for T6. The deck and quick reference guides are in the A5 folder. We need to schedule the sessions for the operators and maintenance staff. I can lead the training.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T6",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 237177,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "My team has the installation checklist and all the tools are ready.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "Great work on the materials. Let's schedule two separate sessions to accommodate shifts. How about Tuesday at 10am for the maintenance team and Wednesday at 2pm for the line operators? Attendance is mandatory for the pilot lines.",
            "mentions": [
              560411
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M61",
            "speaker_id": 55217,
            "reply_to": "M60",
            "text": "Will the training cover the new KPIs? The operators need to understand what we're measuring.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M62",
            "speaker_id": 560411,
            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "Yes, section 4 of the training in A5 is dedicated to the new KPIs from A6, explaining what they mean and how they're measured. The dates work for me.",
            "mentions": [
              55217,
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M63",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M60",
            "text": "Those times should work. I'll inform the line supervisors to ensure their teams are available.",
            "mentions": [
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M64",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M63",
            "text": "Perfect. Let's lock that in. DECISION: Training for maintenance staff is on Tuesday at 10am, and for operators on Wednesday at 2pm. Attendance is mandatory for all pilot team members.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "calendar",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M65",
            "speaker_id": 18383,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "I will be on site during the installation to provide support if there are any electrical issues.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M66",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M65",
            "text": "Appreciate that. Having you there will be a great help.",
            "mentions": [
              18383
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "So to confirm, the go-live is still set for next Monday, correct? All installations will happen in the maintenance windows this week on Thursday and Friday.",
            "mentions": [
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
