          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M67",
            "text": "That is correct. Let's make it official. DECISION: The pilot go-live date is confirmed for next Monday. Installations will occur during the pre-approved maintenance windows on Thursday and Friday.",
            "mentions": [],
