      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Review pilot results, customer impact, and decide on rollout roadmap.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M76",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, the 21-day pilot period has concluded. Thank you all for your hard work. I've compiled the initial findings and recommendations in the Lessons Learned report (A7) as part of T10. The data from A6 shows a 15% reduction in unplanned downtime on the pilot lines, which is a fantastic result. Please review the report and let's discuss the path forward for a wider rollout (A8).",
            "mentions": [
              36422,
              560411,
              18383,
              237177,
              55217
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "T10",
              "A6",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M77",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "This is a great outcome. The MTBF also improved significantly. One key learning for me was the alert response time. It was slow initially but improved dramatically after the first week. This highlights the importance of hands-on training for the next phase.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M78",
            "speaker_id": 560411,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "The data quality from the new sensors was excellent. We caught two potential failures before they happened, saving an estimated 8 hours of downtime. For the scale-up, I recommend we keep the same asset types. The CNC mills and stamping presses are clearly good candidates. We should stick with them for Phase 2.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M79",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M78",
            "text": "I agree. The results speak for themselves. Let's re-confirm our scope for the next phase. DECISION: For the initial scale-up, we will continue to focus on CNC milling machines and primary stamping presses across other production lines.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M80",
            "speaker_id": 237177,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "I talked to the aftersales team for T12. They said they haven't seen any change in calls for those machines yet, but it's probably too soon to tell.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M81",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M80",
            "text": "Thanks for checking. That's expected. Let's continue to monitor this as part of T12 as we roll out further.",
            "mentions": [
              237177
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M82",
            "speaker_id": 55217,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "Did we have any issues with the installations?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M83",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M82",
            "text": "The first installation on Line 5 ran about 30 minutes over, but we made up the time. The checklist in A3 was a huge help. We've already updated it with some notes for the next round.",
            "mentions": [
              55217
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M84",
            "speaker_id": 18383,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "The electrical integration was smooth. No issues with power or interference. The specs we decided on worked well.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M85",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M77",
            "text": "One thing to revisit for the full rollout is the alert ownership. The Operator/Maintenance Tech split worked for the pilot, but as we scale, we might need a dedicated reliability engineer to analyze trends and manage the system. What are your thoughts?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M86",
            "speaker_id": 560411,
            "reply_to": "M85",
            "text": "I strongly agree. Having a dedicated role to manage the model performance, tune thresholds, and perform root cause analysis on complex alerts would be a huge benefit. The current L1/L2 model is great for immediate response, but not for strategic improvement.",
            "mentions": [
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M87",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M85",
            "text": "That's a great point for the long-term roadmap. For now, let's stick with the current model for the next 2-3 lines and build the business case for a new role based on more data. DECISION: We will revisit and finalize the long-term ownership of alert triage after the next phase of the rollout, with a proposal to create a dedicated reliability role.",
            "mentions": [
              36422,
              560411
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M88",
            "speaker_id": 36422,
            "reply_to": "M87",
            "text": "Sounds like a plan. I'll work with you on drafting the rollout roadmap A8.",
            "mentions": [
              53841
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M89",
            "speaker_id": 53841,
            "reply_to": "M88",
            "text": "Excellent. I'll finalize T10 and we can present the results and the plan to leadership next week.",
            "mentions": [
              36422
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M90",
            "speaker_id": 237177,
            "reply_to": "M87",
            "text": "Ok.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
